--TEST--
A `Core\Task::all` field whose function declares a parameter is `E0878` at that field, because each field is called with no arguments — `rule:concurrency/all-answers-a-typed-shape`
--FILE--
<?nvs
type Page = {user: int, orders: int};

Page $page = Core\Task::all({
    user: fn(int $id): int => $id,
    orders: fn(): int => 3,
});
echo $page->orders, "\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0878]: the function in field `user` has 1 parameter(s)
%A
5 |     user: fn(int $id): int => $id,
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `Core\Task::all` calls this with no arguments
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
